WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.300
- [Narrator] Japadog is a portmanteau.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.720
And for those of you that don't
know what a portmanteau is,

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.740
a portmanteau is when you
combine two distinct word forms.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:12.000
In this case, it's Japan and hot dog.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.200
But this is not a story about words.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.100
This, my friends, is a
story about two cultures

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.893
coming together, via hot dog.

00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:22.476
(upbeat music)

00:00:26.043 --> 00:00:28.543
(light music)

00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:07.019
On the menu you'll find
dogs with an assortment

00:01:07.019 --> 00:01:08.768
of traditional Japanese flavors,

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:12.685
such as grated radish,
bonito flakes and nori.

00:02:16.074 --> 00:02:19.324
(bright musical tone)

